# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:19
#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recreates all <filename>Makefile</filename>s beneath a directory"
msgstr "निर्देशिकायाः अधः सर्वाणि <filename>Makefile</filename>s पुनः निर्माति"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:23
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#, no-c-format
msgid "&create_makefiles; <group><replaceable>dir</replaceable></group>"
msgstr "&create_makefiles; <group><replaceable>dir</replaceable></group> इति"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:31
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "वर्णनम्‌"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:33
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&create_makefiles; recreates all <filename>Makefile</filename>s in "
"<replaceable>dir</replaceable> and its (recursed) subdirectories from the "
"corresponding <filename>Makefile.am</filename> templates."
msgstr ""
"&create_makefiles; <replaceable>dir</replaceable> इत्यस्मिन् सर्वाणि "
"<filename>Makefile</filename>s तथा तस्य (पुनरावृत्तिः) उपनिर्देशिकाः "
"तत्सम्बद्धेभ्यः <filename>Makefile.am</filename> टेम्पलेट् इत्यस्मात् पुनः "
"सृजति ।"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:38
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This script must be run from the toplevel directory (the one containing "
"configure). This script saves time compared to re-running configure "
"completely."
msgstr ""
"इयं स्क्रिप्ट् toplevel निर्देशिकातः (configure युक्तात्) चालनीया । एषा "
"स्क्रिप्ट् पूर्णतया विन्यासस्य पुनः चालनस्य तुलने समयस्य रक्षणं करोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:42
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the source directory is different from the build directory (see the "
"environment variables below), it will be assumed that each "
"<filename>Makefile.am</filename> and <filename>Makefile.in</filename> "
"belongs beneath the source directory and that each "
"<filename>Makefile</filename> belongs beneath the build directory."
msgstr ""
"यदि स्रोतनिर्देशिका निर्माणनिर्देशिकातः भिन्ना अस्ति (अधः वातावरणचराः "
"पश्यन्तु), तर्हि प्रत्येकं <filename>Makefile.am</filename> तथा "
"<filename>Makefile.in</filename> इत्येतत् स्रोतनिर्देशिकायाः अधः अस्ति इति "
"कल्प्यते तथा च प्रत्येकं <filename>Makefile</filename> निर्माणनिर्देशिकायाः "
"अधः अस्ति इति ।"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:49
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "This utility is part of the &kde; Software Development Kit."
msgstr "एषा उपयोगिता &kde; सॉफ्टवेयर विकास किट।"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:54
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "पर्यावरणम्‌"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:55
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One of the following variables (but not both) should be set if the source "
"directory is different from the build directory. If the build directory is "
"simply a subdirectory of the source directory, the simpler variable "
"<envar>OBJ_SUBDIR</envar> should be used."
msgstr ""
"यदि स्रोतनिर्देशिका build निर्देशिकातः भिन्ना अस्ति तर्हि निम्नलिखितचरानाम् "
"एकः (किन्तु उभयत्र न) सेट् कर्तव्यः । यदि build निर्देशिका केवलं "
"स्रोतनिर्देशिकायाः उपनिर्देशिका अस्ति तर्हि सरलतरं चरं "
"<envar>OBJ_SUBDIR</envar> उपयोक्तव्यम् ।"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:62
#. Tag: envar
#, no-c-format
msgid "OBJ_SUBJDIR"
msgstr "OBJ_SUBJDIR"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:63
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Indicates that the build directory is in the given subdirectory of the "
"source directory. For instance, if the source directory is <filename "
"class=\"directory\">kdesdk</filename> and the build directory is <filename "
"class=\"directory\">kdesdk/obj-i386-linux</filename>, then "
"<envar>OBJ_SUBDIR</envar> should be set to "
"<parameter>obj-i386-linux</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"build directory स्रोतनिर्देशिकायाः दत्ते उपनिर्देशिकायां अस्ति इति सूचयति । "
"यथा, यदि स्रोतनिर्देशिका <filename class=\"directory\">kdesdk</filename> "
"अस्ति तथा च निर्माणनिर्देशिका <filename "
"class=\"directory\">kdesdk/obj-i386-linux</filename> अस्ति, तर्हि <envar> "
"OBJ_SUBDIR</envar> इत्येतत् <parameter>obj-i386-linux</parameter> इति सेट् "
"कर्तव्यम् ।"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:66
#. Tag: envar
#, no-c-format
msgid "OBJ_REPLACEMENT"
msgstr "OBJ_REPLACEMENT इति"

# automatic translation
#: man-create_makefiles.1.docbook:67
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <command>sed</command> expression that is used to transform the source "
"directory into the build directory. For instance, if the source directory "
"is <filename class=\"directory\">kdesdk/obj-i386-linux</filename>, then "
"<envar>OBJ_REPLACEMENT</envar> should be set to "
"<parameter>s#kdesdk#kdesdk-obj#</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"एकं <command>sed</command> व्यञ्जनं यत् स्रोतनिर्देशिकायाः "
"निर्माणनिर्देशिकायां परिवर्तनार्थं उपयुज्यते । यथा, यदि स्रोतनिर्देशिका "
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdesdk/obj-i386-linux</filename> अस्ति, तर्हि "
"<envar>OBJ_REPLACEMENT</envar> इति <parameter>s#kdesdk#kdesdk- इति सेट् "
"कर्तव्यम् । obj#</parameter> इति ।"

